```

Do NOT silently show stale/fake data as if it were live.

Implement a clean abstraction such as:

```text
Real API
   ↓
Success → real data

Failure
   ↓
Fallback → mock data + demo indicator
```

Do not put fallback logic inside every React component.

Keep it inside the data/service layer.

