# 31. COMPONENT ARCHITECTURE

Keep responsibilities separated.

Recommended:

```text
UI
 ↓
Hooks / data fetching
 ↓
Next.js API
 ↓
Market service
 ↓
CoinGecko
```

Do not place provider-specific API logic inside:

```text
MarketTable.tsx
MarketCard.tsx
MarketChart.tsx
```

Those components should receive normalized data.

---

# 32. CLIENT/SERVER BOUNDARY

Use Server Components where possible.

Use Client Components only when needed for:

* interactive charts
* search
* filters
* refresh controls
* client-side interactions

Do not turn the entire dashboard into a Client Component unnecessarily.

---

# 33. MOCK DATA POLICY

Existing files under:

```text
src/lib/mock-data/
```

must not be deleted unnecessarily.

They remain useful for:

* fallback
* UI development
* tests
* future development

Clearly distinguish:

```text
REAL MARKET DATA
```

from:

```text
DEMO / FALLBACK DATA
```

