# 39. FINAL PRODUCT STATE

After this task, NEXORA should feel like:

> A real market-data terminal powered by live external market data.

The user should be able to:

```text
Open NEXORA
      ↓
View market overview
      ↓
Search markets
      ↓
Open ETH
      ↓
See current price
      ↓
See market statistics
      ↓
Inspect historical chart
      ↓
See updated timestamp
```

The application should remain visually premium and portfolio-ready.

Most importantly:

> **Do not fake blockchain data.**
> V0.2 is market data only.
> Actual on-chain data begins in V0.4.
